  "explanation": "The question asks for the year(s) when Walter Erskine became the Earl of Mar and Kellie. The provided sources present conflicting claims about different individuals named Walter Erskine. Document D1S4 states that the claim for the earldom of Mar was recognized in 1875, making Walter Henry the Earl of Mar. Document D3S3 indicates that Walter John Francis Erskine succeeded his father in 1888, implying he became the Earl of Mar and Kellie then. Document D2S2 asserts that Walter Erskine became the Earl of Mar and Kellie in 1920. These statements refer to distinct individuals with similar names and titles, so their claims are treated as separate valid answers. The proposed answer '1866' (C3) is not directly supported by any source as the year Walter Erskine became the Earl of Mar and Kellie."
